008\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Quick clarification regarding reach.<br /> So to make sure I got this right (ignoring mana or yantra acquisition):<br /> <br /> 1: If you're casting on someone in a video feed, you need to spend 1 Reach for Sensory range and 1 additional Reach for remote targets, for a total of +2<br /> 2: To cast at a target at Sympathetic range, spend 1 Reach for Sensory range and then DO NOT spend to target a remote target, for a total of +1 Reach.<br /> <br /> Is that correct, or is the remote target requirement also present when casting Sympathetically?</div> </div> </div> </div>Your interpretation is correct.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-25T15:15:36-08:00","id":1038062,"title":"","content":"2) You got it, and you pay a mana instead of a second Reach to affect the remote target.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}